{"ticker":"NDAQ","updated":"2026-10-23T23:21:44Z","profile":{"longName":"Nasdaq, Inc.","shortName":"Nasdaq, Inc.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Financial Data & Stock Exchanges","country":"United States","website":"https://www.nasdaq.com","fullTimeEmployees":9525,"marketCap":57328713728,"trailingPE":28.021856,"forwardPE":21.633251,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":9.918463,"pegRatio":1.66,"targetMeanPrice":114.25,"targetHighPrice":133.0,"targetLowPrice":87.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":16,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.126,"earningsGrowth":0.315,"grossMargins":1.0,"operatingMargins":0.50574,"profitMargins":0.36055002,"totalRevenue":5779999744,"beta":null,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":104.21,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":76.55,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.12},"summary":"Nasdaq, Inc. operates as a technology company that serves capital markets and other industries in the United States and internationally. It operates through three segments: Capital Access Platforms, Financial Technology, and Market Services. The company distributes historical and real-time market data; develops and licenses Nasdaq-branded indices and financial products; provides investor relations intelligence, governance solutions, and sustainability solution products for public and private companies, and organizations, as well as insights and workflow solutions; and operates listing platforms. It also offers Verafin, a cloud-based platform to detect, investigate, and report money laundering and financial frauds; AxiomSL, a risk data management and regulatory reporting solution; cloud-enabled and on-premises surveillance solutions to assist in complying with market rules, regulations, and internal market surveillance policies; Calypso, a platform providing cross-asset, front-to-back trading, treasury, risk, and collateral management solutions; and trade management and colocation services, as well as handles assets comprising cash equities, equity derivatives, currencies, various interest-bearing securities, commodities, energy products, and digital currencies. In addition, the company provides equity derivative trading and clearing, cash equity trading and fixed income, curren","summary_zh":"納斯達克公司是一家科技公司，為美國和國際資本市場和其他行業提供服務。它透過三個部門運作：資本准入平台、金融科技和市場服務。公司發布歷史和即時市場數據；開發並獲得納斯達克品牌指數和金融產品的許可；為上市和私營公司及組織提供投資者關係情報、治理解決方案和可持續發展解決方案產品，以及見解和工作流程解決方案；並運營上市平台。它還提供 Verafin，一個基於雲端的平台，用於檢測、調查和報告洗錢和金融詐欺行為； AxiomSL，風險數據管理和監管報告解決方案；支援雲端和本地監控解決方案，以協助遵守市場規則、法規和內部市場監控政策； Calypso，一個提供跨資產、前後交易、資金、風險和抵押品管理解決方案的平台；交易管理和託管服務，並處理包括現金股票、股票衍生品、貨幣、各種有息證券、商品、能源產品和數位貨幣在內的資產。此外，公司還提供股權衍生性商品交易和清算、現金股權交易和固定收益、流動性","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"財務數據和證券交易所","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":94.62,"h":95.1,"l":94.22,"c":94.32,"v":1685100},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":94.16,"h":95.15,"l":94.05,"c":94.9,"v":3019700},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":94.6,"h":95.29,"l":94.5,"c":94.84,"v":1967800},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":94.93,"h":95.32,"l":94.37,"c":95.24,"v":2018500},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":95.38,"h":95.75,"l":94.41,"c":94.74,"v":1742300},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":93.27,"h":94.38,"l":92.9,"c":93.59,"v":3109100},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":93.59,"h":93.9,"l":92.87,"c":93.77,"v":1831700},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":94.06,"h":94.4,"l":93.66,"c":94.3,"v":3693400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":94.52,"h":94.8,"l":92.12,"c":93.48,"v":3771400},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":93.83,"h":95.05,"l":93.5,"c":94.99,"v":3879300},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":95.12,"h":95.37,"l":94.7,"c":94.88,"v":2653900},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":94.91,"h":95.86,"l":94.23,"c":94.66,"v":2465800},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":94.72,"h":96.16,"l":94.7,"c":95.88,"v":2879000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":95.74,"h":96.14,"l":93.89,"c":93.95,"v":2948500},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":94.16,"h":94.31,"l":92.73,"c":92.86,"v":4971200},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":93.0,"h":93.17,"l":92.43,"c":92.54,"v":5223800},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":92.8,"h":94.05,"l":92.55,"c":93.1,"v":3168500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":93.25,"h":93.89,"l":88.63,"c":88.87,"v":9834700},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":89.22,"h":89.93,"l":88.67